# The tests' clang-tidy: the repository's checks (../.clang-tidy), but for the static analyzer's memory checks, which
# doctest's CHECK macros trip in doctest's own code (2026-11-14: a "use after release" in its String, and a "leak" of
# what its expression templates keep).
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: -clang-analyzer-cplusplus.NewDelete,-clang-analyzer-cplusplus.NewDeleteLeaks
